# Peak Works - product versions.
#
# This file is the single source of truth for version numbers. Nothing else
# in the tree may hard-code a version: tools\build.bat reads the line for the
# model being built and generates src\VERSION.H from it, and the About box
# shows what it generated.
#
# One line per product, "<model>=<major>.<minor>.<patch>". No spaces.
# The model name must match a file in config\, e.g. gc323 -> config\gc323.h.
#
# Bump patch for a bug-fix release, minor for new behaviour, major for a
# change that breaks methods, data files or the instrument interface.
# Every bump needs a matching section in CHANGELOG.md and a bug list in
# docs\bugs\.

gc323=2.5.0
gc301=2.5.0
m30=0.1.0
